'''Manigism'''<!--"Manig" is Old English for Many--> is a [[wikipedia:Polytheism|polytheistic]] religion with adherents throughout [[Basis]] but mainly in [[Daroch]]. 

Manigists believe in the concept of [[wikipedia:eternal return|eternal return]], where time repeats itself in an infinite loop, and that exactly the same events continue to occur in exactly the same way, over and over again, for eternity. The core theology of Manigism is for its adherents to seek liberation from this endless cycle of birth, life, and death. 

